BAUXBSD window manager - minimal, keyboard-driven X11 window manager
based on dwm with BAUX session integration.

Features:
- Session display in status bar when BAUXWM=1
- Mod4+1-9 for session switching (matches tmux)
- Gruvbox theming with toxic green color scheme
- Minimal footprint (~25MB installed)
- Keyboard-native, no mouse required

WWW: https://roxieos.org